<section class="lf-work-intro"><div class="container"><p class="section-kicker">FEATURED PROJECTS</p><h2>Websites built around a clear next step.</h2><p>Start with two recent service-business projects. Explore the challenge, the approach and the work delivered—without inflated claims or invented performance numbers.</p><div class="lf-work-cards"><article class="lf-rework__card"><a class="lf-rework__picture" href="/work/cypress-christmas-lights/" aria-label="View Cypress Christmas Lights"><img src="/work/cypress-christmas-lights.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Screenshot of Cypress Christmas Lights website" /></a><div class="lf-rework__body"><p class="lf-rework__type">Lead-generation website and booking funnel</p><h3>Cypress Christmas Lights</h3><p>Service-business landing experience with a project-specific inquiry and booking journey.</p><a class="lf-rework__go" href="/work/cypress-christmas-lights/">Explore project ↗</a></div></article><article class="lf-rework__card"><a class="lf-rework__picture" href="/work/sonya-hair-braiding/" aria-label="View Sonya Hair Braiding"><img src="/work/sonya-hair-braiding.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Screenshot of Sonya Hair Braiding website" /></a><div class="lf-rework__body"><p class="lf-rework__type">Salon website and appointment funnel</p><h3>Sonya Hair Braiding</h3><p>Salon-focused website with a customer inquiry and booking journey.</p><a class="lf-rework__go" href="/work/sonya-hair-braiding/">Explore project ↗</a></div></article></div></div></section>
<section class="lf-work-intro" style="background:#fff"><div class="container"><p class="section-kicker">MORE PROJECTS</p><h2>More website work.</h2><p>Selected projects across different industries and website needs.</p><div class="lf-work-cards"><article class="lf-rework__card"><a class="lf-rework__picture" href="https://mspautomations.co/" aria-label="View MSP Automations"><img src="/work/msp-automations.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Screenshot of MSP Automations website" /></a><div class="lf-rework__body"><p class="lf-rework__type">Automation services website</p><h3>MSP Automations</h3><p>Service website positioning managed IT automation offerings.</p><a class="lf-rework__go" href="https://mspautomations.co/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore project ↗</a></div></article><article class="lf-rework__card"><a class="lf-rework__picture" href="https://www.whochangedthechurch.com/" aria-label="View Who Changed the Church"><img src="/work/who-changed-the-church.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Screenshot of Who Changed the Church website" /></a><div class="lf-rework__body"><p class="lf-rework__type">Editorial website</p><h3>Who Changed the Church</h3><p>Research and book-focused content experience.</p><a class="lf-rework__go" href="https://www.whochangedthechurch.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore project ↗</a></div></article><article class="lf-rework__card"><a class="lf-rework__picture" href="/contact/" aria-label="Discuss similar work"><img src="/work/jolly-jude.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Screenshot of Jolly Jude website" /></a><div class="lf-rework__body"><p class="lf-rework__type">Website design</p><h3>Jolly Jude</h3><p>Community-focused website presentation.</p></div></article><article class="lf-rework__card"><a class="lf-rework__picture" href="/contact/" aria-label="Discuss similar work"><img src="/work/saturdaytosold.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Screenshot of Saturday to Sold website" /></a><div class="lf-rework__body"><p class="lf-rework__type">Property seller landing page</p><h3>Saturday to Sold</h3><p>Offer-focused real estate landing page.</p></div></article><article class="lf-rework__card"><a class="lf-rework__picture" href="/contact/" aria-label="Discuss similar work"><img src="/work/soldovertheweekend.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Screenshot of Sold Over the Weekend website" /></a><div class="lf-rework__body"><p class="lf-rework__type">Real estate lead generation</p><h3>Sold Over the Weekend</h3><p>Homeowner-oriented landing page.</p></div></article><article class="lf-rework__card"><a class="lf-rework__picture" href="/contact/" aria-label="Discuss similar work"><img src="/work/triya.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Screenshot of Triya website" /></a><div class="lf-rework__body"><p class="lf-rework__type">E-commerce website</p><h3>Triya</h3><p>Product-focused online storefront.</p></div></article><article class="lf-rework__card"><a class="lf-rework__picture" href="/contact/" aria-label="Discuss similar work"><img src="/work/wednesday-tech.webp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Screenshot of Wednesday Tech website" /></a><div class="lf-rework__body"><p class="lf-rework__type">Business website</p><h3>Wednesday Tech</h3><p>Professional services website.</p></div></article></div></div></section>
<section class="lf-end-cta"><div class="container lf-cta-inner"><div><p class="section-kicker">YOUR NEXT PROJECT</p><h2>Need a website that helps visitors take action?</h2></div><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Let's talk ↗</a></div></section>

